1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,790
Look! Bright sunshine at the beach!

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,909
What do we wear? Can you guess?

3
00:00:08,709 --> 00:00:10,329
Yes! We wear sunglasses!

4
00:00:10,829 --> 00:00:12,701
Say it with me! Sunglasses!

5
00:00:16,001 --> 00:00:18,141
Look! Rain and big splashy puddles!

6
00:00:18,541 --> 00:00:19,883
What do we wear on our feet?

7
00:00:23,683 --> 00:00:25,828
Yes! We wear boots! Splash, splash!

8
00:00:26,328 --> 00:00:27,810
Say it with me! Boots!

9
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,250
Look! A windy day with falling leaves!

10
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:35,100
What do we wear around our neck?

11
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:40,272
Yes! We wear a scarf!

12
00:00:40,772 --> 00:00:42,309
Say it with me! Scarf!

13
00:00:45,609 --> 00:00:47,518
Look! Cold snow and a snowman!

14
00:00:47,918 --> 00:00:50,142
Last one! What do we wear on our hands?

15
00:00:53,942 --> 00:00:56,121
Yes! We wear gloves! Nice and warm!

16
00:00:56,621 --> 00:00:58,174
Say it with me! Gloves!

17
00:01:01,174 --> 00:01:03,670
Wow! You got them all! How many did you guess?

